ivacy notice</a></p></div></section>\n<main><div class=\"member-bar\">Private community directory · <span id=\"memberPhone\"></span><br>Please keep contacts and reviews within the group. After 90 days, ask the PM on WhatsApp for a new access code to sign in again.</div>\n<section class=\"hero\"><h1>Find the help that’s right for you.</h1><p>Local contacts in Sicily. Community reviews to help you choose.</p></section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"finderTitle\" id=\"directory\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"finderTitle\">Crew finder</h2><p>Search by name, service, problem or town.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"filters\"><label>Search<input id=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Name, service or problem\" oninput=\"clearSuggested();render()\"></label><label>Category<select id=\"category\" onchange=\"changeCategory()\"><option value=\"\">All categories</option></select></label><label>Service<select id=\"trade\" onchange=\"clearSuggested();render()\"><option value=\"\">All services</option></select></label><label>Town<select id=\"town\" onchange=\"render()\"><option value=\"\">All towns</option></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"result-tools\"><span id=\"count\" class=\"muted\" aria-live=\"polite\">Loading directory…</span><div class=\"sort-tools\"><label>Sort by<select id=\"sort\" onchange=\"render()\"><option value=\"name\">Name A–Z</option><option value=\"rating\">Highest rating</option><option value=\"reviews\">Most reviews</option></select></label><button onclick=\"resetFilters()\">Clear filters</button></div></div><section id=\"cards\" class=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Local contacts\"></section></section>\n\n<section class=\"help interior360-contact\" aria-label=\"Interior360 renovation services\"><div><span class=\"notice\">Interior360 services</span><h2>Need help designing or managing your renovation?</h2><p>Talk to Marcin at Interior360 about your renovation in Sicily.</p></div><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://wa.me/48603760320?text=Hi%20Marci